comments.body:
@MicahZoltu we've discussed (and agreed) on the last two ACDEs to "include" and EIP in Fusaka that mentions raising the default gas limit. It's unusual, I agree, but we went back and forth on the approach and landed on this. The expectation is that by the fork, we know what value is safe and move defaults towards that. 

@will-corcoran ty, noted! 

@SirSpudlington if there's time, we will cover it, but it may be easier to get an answer to this async.
